WEBVTT

00:07:59.187 --> 00:08:02.349
efficient and humane.

00:08:02.349 --> 00:08:04.543
It allows us to be creative.

00:08:04.543 --> 00:08:07.763
We can design new materials, new products,

00:08:07.763 --> 00:08:10.962
and new facilities.

00:08:10.962 --> 00:08:14.802
We need to move past just killing animals

00:08:14.802 --> 00:08:16.635
as a resource

00:08:16.635 --> 00:08:22.556
to something more civilized and evolved.

00:08:22.556 --> 00:08:25.241
Perhaps we are ready for something

00:08:25.241 --> 00:08:30.826
literally and figuratively more cultured.